{
  "id": "phy6-c5-s2",
  "card_id": "phy6-c5-s2",
  "chapter": "功和功率、能量",
  "section": null,
  "number": "69",
  "title": "功率　功率的单位",
  "printed_title": "69. 功率　功率的单位",
  "start_page": 186,
  "start_printed": 175,
  "figures": [
    {
      "id": "tbl-p0188-01",
      "label": "表",
      "page": 188
    }
  ],
  "exercise_count": 12,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "用不同的动力来完成等量的机械功，所需的时间是不同的. 例如，在建筑工地上用起重机可以把几百块砖在几分钟内就送到楼的上层去. 而这些砖若由一个工人来背，他就要干整整一个工作日. 又如一匹好马在10—12 小时内可以耕1公顷土地，而配备着多铧犁的拖拉机在40—50 分钟内就能完成这么多工作.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0186#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "很明显，在做等量的功时，起重机比工人快，拖拉机比马快. 在工程技术中就用一个叫做功率的专门物理量来描写做功的快慢.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0186#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**我们把在数值上与单位时间内所做的功相等的量叫做功****率.**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0186#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "功率表示的是单位时间内所做功的多少，可以把功率看成是做功的速度.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0186#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**要计算功率，需将功除以做这个功所用的时间：**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0186#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**功率**$=\\frac{\\textbf{功}}{\\textbf{时间}}$，或$N=\\frac{A}{t}$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0186#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "式中 $N$——功率，$A$——功，$t$——做功的时间.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0186#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**我们把单位时间内完成单位功的功率取做功率的单位.**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0186#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "若把功的单位取为焦耳，时间的单位取为秒，则功率的单位即为焦耳/秒. 这个单位叫做**瓦特**. （简称为瓦.）",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 175,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0186#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**1 瓦特**$=\\frac{\\textbf{1 焦耳}}{\\textbf{1 秒}}$，**或 1 瓦特$=$1 焦/秒.**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在工程技术中广泛地使用着另一些大得多的功率单位——千瓦、兆瓦、马力等. 1 千瓦$=1000$ 瓦特；1 兆瓦$=1000000$ 瓦特；1 马力$=736$ 瓦特.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例题　试求流过堤坝的水流的功率，已知水的落差为25米，流量是每分钟120 米$^3$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**解：**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "1 分钟内落下的水的质量是 $m=\\rho V$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$m=1000$ 千克/米$^3\\times120$ 米$^3=120000$ 千克.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "作用在这部分水上的重力为",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$F=9.8$ 牛顿/千克$\\times120000$ 千克$\\approx1200000$ 牛顿.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "故水流在1 分钟内所做的功为 $A=Fh$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$A=1200000$ 牛顿$\\times25$ 米$=30000000$ 焦耳.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "水流的功率 $N=\\frac{A}{t}$；而 $t=1$ 分钟$=60$ 秒，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "故",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$N=\\frac{30000000\\text{焦耳}}{60\\text{秒}}=500000$ 瓦特$=0.5$ 兆瓦.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "各种不同的发动机的功率也很不相同，小的只有百分之几甚至千分之几千瓦（如电动刮脸刀和缝纫机上用的电动机），大的可达几十万千瓦（如水轮机和汽轮机）. 每台发动机上都有一个小牌子（铭牌），上面写着有关该发动机的几项数据，功率就是其中的一项.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "人在正常工作条件下工作时的功率平均为70—80 瓦特.当人跳跃时或跑上楼梯时的功率可达730 瓦特左右. 在一些个别的场合，功率甚至还可以更大些.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 176,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0187#15",
        "p0188#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "**发动机功率举例**（单位：千瓦）",
      "id": null,
      "label": "表",
      "printed_page": 177,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0188#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "tbl-p0188-01",
      "label": "表",
      "printed_page": 177,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0188#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "知道了发动机的功率，就可以计算这台发动机在任一段时间间隔内所做的功. 由公式 $N=\\frac{A}{t}$ 可得",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 177,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0188#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$A=Nt$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 177,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0188#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例题　电风扇上的电动机的功率为35 瓦特，试求电动机在10 分钟内所做的功.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 177,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0188#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**解：**　　　　　$A=Nt$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 177,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0188#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$A=35\\text{ 瓦特}\\times600\\text{ 秒}=21000\\text{ 瓦特}\\cdot\\text{秒}=21000\\text{ 焦耳}=21\\text{ 千焦耳}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 177,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0188#8"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
